          ":question/id": "abf235b3-2d59-5bfb-aea0-aa237461f6b8",
          ":question/math-academy-id": "q-73954",
          ":question/problem": "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}16 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -18\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$",
          ":question/worked-solution": "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}16 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -18\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}-2{x}_{1} \\\\ 3{x}_{1} \\\\ 4{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}5{x}_{2} \\\\ 4{x}_{2} \\\\ -3{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}16 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -18\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}-2{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2} \\\\ 3{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2} \\\\ 4{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}16 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -18\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2} &=16 \\\\ 3{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2} &=-1 \\\\ 4{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2} &=-18\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nMultiplying the first equation by $3$, the second equation by $2$, and adding the resulting equations, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}15{x}_{2}+8{x}_{2} & =48-2 \\\\ 23{x}_{2} & =46 \\\\ {x}_{2} & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we substitute ${x}_{2}=2$  into the second equation to get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2} & =-1\\text{\u00a0} \\\\ 3{x}_{1}+4(2) & =-1 \\\\ 3{x}_{1} & =-9 \\\\ {x}_{1} & =-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=-3$ and ${x}_{2}=2$ into our third equation to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2} & =-18 \\\\ 4(-3)-3(2) & =-18 \\\\ -18 & =-18,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a true statement. \n\nSo, the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=-3$ and ${x}_{2}=2,$ which means\n\n$$\n-3{a}_{1}+2{a}_{2}=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=(-3)+2=-1.\n$$"
        },
